### ========================================
### 🔥 FINEXT API - TESTES
### ========================================
### Instale a extensão "REST Client" no VS Code
### Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada ###
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = SEU_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

### ========================================
### 1️⃣ HEALTH CHECK
### ========================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### ========================================
### 2️⃣ AUTENTICAÇÃO — TRADICIONAL
### ========================================

### 📝 Registrar novo usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Gustavo",
  "last_name": "Silva",
  "email": "gustavo.teste@example.com",
  "password": "senha123456",
  "phone": "+5511999999999"
}

### 🔐 Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gustavo.teste@example.com",
  "password": "senha123456"
}

### 🔄 Refresh Token (lê do cookie automaticamente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

### 🚪 Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔑 Alterar senha (usuário já tem senha)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "senha123456",
  "new_password": "novaSenha789"
}

### 🔒 Definir senha (usuário veio do Google e ainda não tem senha)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/set-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "new_password": "minhaSenha123",
  "confirm_password": "minhaSenha123"
}

### ========================================
### 3️⃣ AUTENTICAÇÃO — SOCIAL (FIREBASE/GOOGLE)
### ========================================

### 🌐 Login / Registro via Google
### (id_token obtido pelo Firebase Web SDK no frontend)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "id_token": "FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN_AQUI",
  "device_info": "Chrome 121 / Windows 11"
}

### 🔗 Vincular conta Google a uma conta existente
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/social/link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "id_token": "FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN_AQUI"
}

### 🔓 Desvincular provider Google
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auth/social/google
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📋 Listar providers vinculados
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/social/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 4️⃣ USUÁRIO (PERFIL)
### ========================================

### 👤 Ver meu perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✏️ Atualizar perfil
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Gustavo",
  "last_name": "Silva",
  "phone": "+5565993634954",
  "timezone": "America/Cuiaba"
}

### 🗑️ Desativar conta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ⚙️ Ver configurações
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔧 Atualizar configurações
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notification_email": true,
  "notification_push": true,
  "notification_sms": false,
  "budget_alerts": true,
  "bill_reminders": true,
  "bill_reminder_days": 3,
  "weekly_summary": true,
  "monthly_report": true,
  "low_balance_alert": true,
  "low_balance_threshold": 200.00,
  "allow_manual_transactions": true
}

### ========================================
### 5️⃣ CATEGORIAS
### ========================================

### 📋 Listar todas as categorias
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📋 Listar apenas despesas
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?type=expense
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📋 Listar apenas receitas
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?type=income
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 💡 Sugerir categoria por descrição
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/suggest?description=Almoço no restaurante
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👁️ Ver categoria por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/CATEGORY_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar categoria (Despesa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pet Shop",
  "type": "expense",
  "icon": "🐾",
  "color": "#F59E0B",
  "description": "Gastos com animais de estimação"
}

### 📝 Criar categoria (Receita)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aluguel Recebido",
  "type": "income",
  "icon": "🏠",
  "color": "#22C55E",
  "description": "Receita de aluguel de imóvel"
}

### ✏️ Atualizar categoria
PUT {{baseUrl}}/categories/CATEGORY_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pet & Vet",
  "icon": "🐶",
  "color": "#F97316"
}

### 🗑️ Deletar categoria
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/CATEGORY_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 6️⃣ CONTAS BANCÁRIAS
### ========================================

### 🏦 Listar todas as contas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 💰 Saldo total consolidado
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👁️ Ver conta por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar conta corrente (Nubank)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nubank",
  "bank_name": "Nubank",
  "account_type": "checking",
  "initial_balance": 2500.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "color": "#8B5CF6",
  "include_in_total": true
}

### 📝 Criar poupança
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Poupança Itaú",
  "bank_name": "Itaú",
  "account_type": "savings",
  "initial_balance": 5000.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "color": "#F59E0B",
  "include_in_total": true
}

### 📝 Criar cartão de crédito
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cartão Inter",
  "bank_name": "Banco Inter",
  "account_type": "credit_card",
  "initial_balance": 0.00,
  "credit_limit": 5000.00,
  "closing_day": 20,
  "due_day": 5,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "color": "#EC4899",
  "include_in_total": false
}

### 📝 Criar carteira (dinheiro físico)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carteira",
  "account_type": "cash",
  "initial_balance": 150.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "color": "#10B981",
  "include_in_total": true
}

### ✏️ Atualizar conta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nubank Pessoal",
  "color": "#7C3AED"
}

### 🗑️ Deletar conta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 7️⃣ TRANSAÇÕES
### ========================================

### 💸 Listar todas as transações
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 💸 Listar com filtros
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=expense&start_date=2026-02-01&end_date=2026-02-28&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📅 Próximas contas a vencer (padrão 7 dias)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📅 Próximas contas (30 dias)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/upcoming?days=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👁️ Ver transação por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/TRANSACTION_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar despesa (paga)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bank_account_id": "ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI",
  "category_id": "CATEGORY_ID_AQUI",
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 45.50,
  "description": "Almoço no restaurante",
  "transaction_date": "2026-02-04",
  "is_paid": true
}

### 📝 Criar receita
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bank_account_id": "ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI",
  "category_id": "CATEGORY_ID_AQUI",
  "type": "income",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "description": "Salário de Fevereiro",
  "transaction_date": "2026-02-01",
  "is_paid": true
}

### 📝 Criar conta a pagar (pendente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bank_account_id": "ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI",
  "category_id": "CATEGORY_ID_AQUI",
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 850.00,
  "description": "Fatura do cartão Inter",
  "transaction_date": "2026-02-20",
  "due_date": "2026-02-20",
  "is_paid": false
}

### ✏️ Atualizar transação
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/TRANSACTION_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço no restaurante japonês",
  "amount": 60.00
}

### ✅ Marcar transação como paga
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/TRANSACTION_ID_AQUI/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🗑️ Deletar transação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/TRANSACTION_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 8️⃣ TRANSAÇÕES RECORRENTES
### ========================================

### 📋 Listar todas as recorrentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📋 Listar apenas ativas
GET {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions?is_active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📊 Estatísticas de recorrentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📅 Próximas ocorrências (padrão 30 dias)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions/upcoming
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📅 Próximas ocorrências (60 dias)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions/upcoming?days=60
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👁️ Ver recorrente por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions/RECURRING_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar recorrente mensal (salário)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bank_account_id": "ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI",
  "category_id": "CATEGORY_ID_AQUI",
  "type": "income",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "description": "Salário",
  "frequency": "monthly",
  "day_of_month": 5,
  "start_date": "2026-01-05",
  "auto_confirm": true
}

### 📝 Criar recorrente semanal (almoço)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bank_account_id": "ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI",
  "category_id": "CATEGORY_ID_AQUI",
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "description": "Almoço semanal",
  "frequency": "weekly",
  "day_of_week": 5,
  "start_date": "2026-02-07",
  "auto_confirm": false
}

### 📝 Criar recorrente anual (IPTU)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bank_account_id": "ACCOUNT_ID_AQUI",
  "category_id": "CATEGORY_ID_AQUI",
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 1200.00,
  "description": "IPTU",
  "frequency": "yearly",
  "day_of_month": 10,
  "start_date": "2026-01-10",
  "auto_confirm": false
}

### ✏️ Atualizar recorrente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions/RECURRING_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5500.00,
  "description": "Salário (com aumento)"
}

### ⏸️ Pausar / Reativar recorrente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions/RECURRING_ID_AQUI/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": false
}

### 🗑️ Deletar recorrente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/recurring-transactions/RECURRING_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 9️⃣ ORÇAMENTOS
### ========================================

### 💰 Listar todos os orçamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 💰 Listar apenas ativos
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets?is_active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📊 Resumo dos orçamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👁️ Ver orçamento por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/BUDGET_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar orçamento mensal
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alimentação Fevereiro 2026",
  "category_id": "CATEGORY_ID_AQUI",
  "amount": 800.00,
  "period_type": "monthly",
  "start_date": "2026-02-01",
  "end_date": "2026-02-28",
  "alert_threshold": 80
}

### 📝 Criar orçamento anual
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lazer 2026",
  "category_id": "CATEGORY_ID_AQUI",
  "amount": 6000.00,
  "period_type": "yearly",
  "start_date": "2026-01-01",
  "end_date": "2026-12-31",
  "alert_threshold": 90
}

### ✏️ Atualizar orçamento
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/BUDGET_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 900.00,
  "alert_threshold": 85
}

### 🗑️ Deletar orçamento
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budgets/BUDGET_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 🔟 METAS FINANCEIRAS
### ========================================

### 🎯 Listar todas as metas
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🎯 Listar apenas ativas
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals?status=in_progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📊 Resumo das metas
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👁️ Ver meta por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals/GOAL_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📝 Criar meta (Viagem)
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Viagem para Europa",
  "description": "Guardar para viagem de férias em julho",
  "target_amount": 10000.00,
  "target_date": "2026-07-01",
  "icon": "✈️",
  "color": "#3B82F6",
  "priority": 2
}

### 📝 Criar meta (Reserva de Emergência)
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Reserva de Emergência",
  "description": "Guardar 6 meses de salário",
  "target_amount": 30000.00,
  "target_date": "2026-12-31",
  "icon": "🛡️",
  "color": "#22C55E",
  "priority": 1
}

### ✏️ Atualizar meta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/goals/GOAL_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Viagem para Europa e Ásia",
  "target_amount": 15000.00,
  "target_date": "2026-08-01"
}

### 💰 Adicionar contribuição à meta
POST {{baseUrl}}/goals/GOAL_ID_AQUI/contributions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 500.00,
  "contribution_date": "2026-02-04",
  "note": "Contribuição mensal de fevereiro"
}

### 📋 Listar contribuições da meta
GET {{baseUrl}}/goals/GOAL_ID_AQUI/contributions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🗑️ Deletar meta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/goals/GOAL_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 1️⃣1️⃣ DASHBOARD
### ========================================

### 📊 Resumo geral do dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 💵 Fluxo de caixa (mês atual)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/cash-flow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 💵 Fluxo de caixa (intervalo customizado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/cash-flow?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📈 Receitas vs Despesas
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/income-expense
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📅 Comparação mensal (padrão 6 meses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/monthly-comparison
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📅 Comparação mensal (12 meses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/monthly-comparison?months=12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🏦 Saldos das contas
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/account-balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### 1️⃣2️⃣ NOTIFICAÇÕES
### ========================================

### 📬 Listar todas as notificações (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📬 Listar com paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 📭 Notificações não lidas
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🔢 Contagem de não lidas
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread/count
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✅ Marcar notificação como lida
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/NOTIFICATION_ID_AQUI/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✅ Marcar todas como lidas
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🗑️ Deletar notificação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/NOTIFICATION_ID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

